Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 23:27:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add SynFlowNet synthesizable-molecule generation tool

Add a new `molecular_generation` tool category with the `synflownet` toolkit,
wrapping SynFlowNet (a GFlowNet over a synthesis action space) as the
`synflownet-sample` tool: Input/Config/Output/Metrics, standalone inference
env (user-provisioned checkpoint via the ASSET_NOT_AVAILABLE pattern, since
SynFlowNet ships no public weights), README/cite.bib/license.yaml/links.yaml,
example notebook, tests (incl. a device-agnostic benchmark), and the full
export chain. Also add the Modal deployment (service + manifest wiring +
regenerated tool_map) and list the category in the README catalog.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
