+# SynFlowNet deployment
+
+Modal deployment for the [`synflownet` toolkit](../../../tools/molecular_generation/synflownet/README.md)
+(`synflownet-sample`).
+
+## Provisioning the checkpoint
+
+SynFlowNet has no publicly distributed weights, so this service needs a **trained checkpoint**
+before it can serve requests. Train a model with the
+[upstream repo](https://github.com/mirunacrt/synflownet) and place the resulting `model_state.pt`
+on the Modal weights volume under `synflownet/model_state.pt` (the `PROTO_MODEL_CACHE` mount at
+`/weights`). Requests then run with `model_checkpoint="default"`.
+
+Because there are no weights to warm, the build-time warmup only bakes the tool source into the
+image; the standalone environment is built on the first request once the checkpoint is present.
+
+## Benchmarks
+
+_Not yet recorded. Deployment benchmark tables here are generated by
+`pytest --benchmark --use-modal` once the service has been deployed with a provisioned checkpoint._
